st for cobblestone walking, mountain roads, mine tours, churches, hiking","when_source":"derived from destination timing","timing_type":"SEASONAL-WINDOW","si":"adventure","when":"Dry season Apr–Sep — best for cobblestone walking, mountain roads, mine tours, churches, hiking","commission":"DMC / lodge; guided hikes via operator","wells":["activities"],"wells_basis":"derived from name/blurb/hook","si_all":["adventure"],"shelf_fit":{"adventure":"primary","culinary":"destination","culture":"destination","romance":"destination"},"commission_lane":["operator","DMC","hotel","guide"],"commission_embedded":false,"commission_basis":"lane"},{"name":"Serra do Cipó National Park","tier":"comfort","source":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Serra_do_Cip%C3%B3_National_Park","timing":"Dry season Apr–Sep — best for cobblestone walking, mountain roads, mine tours, churches, hiking","when_source":"derived from destination timing","timing_type":"SEASONAL-WINDOW","hook":"~100 km from Belo Horizonte; canyons, waterfalls, maned wolf + giant anteater, hikes easy→challenging","si":"adventure","blurb":"~100 km from Belo Horizonte; canyons, waterfalls, maned wolf + giant anteater, hikes easy→challenging","when":"Dry season Apr–Sep — best for cobblestone walking, mountain roads, mine tours, churches, hiking","commission":"DMC / tour affiliate; guided on remoter trails","wells":["activities"],"wells_basis":"derived from name/blurb/hook","si_all":["adventure"],"shelf_fit":{"adventure":"primary","culinary":"destination","culture":"destination","romance":"destination"},"commission_lane":["DMC","affiliate","guide"],"commission_embedded":false,"commission_basis":"lane"}],"faq":[{"q":"When is the best time to visit Ouro Preto, Tiradentes & Colonial Minas, Brazil?","a":"**Semana Santa (Holy Week) in Ouro Preto is world-famous — and books out.** In 2026 Holy Week runs **29 March – 4 April** (Easter Sunday 5 April). Ouro Preto stages no fewer than eight processions across the week, walking over vast street \"carpets\" (tapetes) made of colored sawdust, sand and flowers. It is the marquee cultural event of the year and rooms vanish months ahead.","source":"https://www.catholicsandcultures.org/brazil/holy-week-ouro-preto","accessed":"2026-07-07"},{"q":"How do I get to Ouro Preto, Tiradentes & Colonial Minas, Brazil?","a":"**The Maria-Fumaça steam train runs weekends only.** The vintage steam locomotive between São João del-Rei and Tiradentes operates **Fridays, Saturdays and Sundays**; one-way ~R$86 full fare, round trip ~R$172. Plan the circuit around the weekend if the train is a must-do.","source":"https://www.civitatis.com/en/ouro-preto/sao-joao-rei-tiradentes-maria-fumaca/","accessed":"2026-07-07"},{"q":"What is worth doing in Ouro Preto, Tiradentes & Colonial Minas, Brazil?","a":"São Francisco de Assis (Ouro Preto) — widely regarded as Aleijadinho''s masterpiece; richly carved facade + interior with Athayde ceiling. The single most important baroque church in Brazil.","source":"https://whc.unesco.org/en/list/124"}],"seo":{"meta_title":"Ouro Preto, Tiradentes & Colonial Minas Gerais Travel Guide 2026 — Baroque Churches, Aleijadinho, Inhotim & Mineiro Food | TravelWell","jsonld_type":"TouristDestination","search_language":"pt-BR","local_keywords":["o que fazer em Ouro Preto","Tiradentes Maria Fumaça","Inhotim","cidades históricas Minas","igrejas barrocas de Ouro Preto Aleijadinho","Congonhas Doze Profetas","Mina da Passagem Mariana","Semana Santa Ouro Preto tapetes","Festival de Cultura e Gastronomia de Tiradentes","comida mineira pão de queijo feijão tropeiro","pousadas de charme em Tiradentes","lua de mel em Minas Gerais"],"hreflang":["en","pt-BR"],"attribution":{"author":{"type":"Organization","name":"TravelWell.World"},"publisher":{"type":"Organization","name":"TravelWell.World LLC"},"reviewed_by":{"type":"Organization","name":"TravelWell.World"},"digital_source_type":"CompositeWithTrainedAlgorithmicMediaDigitalSource","digital_source_vocab":"https://schema.org