locos across the city","when":"Austral summer  — hottest, most crowded, most expensive","commission":"DMC package carries margin; face-value tickets non-commissionable","wells":["activities"],"wells_basis":"full pass 2026-10-05, additive — text","si_all":["culture"],"shelf_fit":{"culture":"primary","romance":"destination","tropical":"destination"},"commission_lane":["DMC","package"],"commission_embedded":false,"commission_basis":"lane"}],"faq":[{"q":"When is the best time to visit Rio de Janeiro, Brazil?","a":"**Rio''s summer is the peak, and it is expensive.** December to February is the hottest, most crowded, most costly window — temperatures push past 40 °C (104 °F) and humidity runs 75–90%. Hotel rates *double or triple* around Carnival and New Year''s Eve, and flights vanish weeks out.","source":"https://travel.usnews.com/Rio_de_Janeiro_Brazil/When_To_Visit/","accessed":"2026-07-07"},{"q":"What is worth doing in Rio de Janeiro, Brazil?","a":"Christ the Redeemer / Corcovado (dawn van) — the New Seven Wonders statue, best experienced on an early van tour before the crowds and haze.","source":"https://www.getyourguide.com/explorer/rio-de-janeiro-ttd9/best-time-to-visit-rio-de-janeiro/"}],"seo":{"meta_title":"Rio de Janeiro Travel Guide 2026 — Carnival, Christ the Redeemer, Beaches & Búzios | TravelWell","jsonld_type":"TouristDestination","search_language":"pt-BR","local_keywords":["o que fazer no Rio de Janeiro","Cristo Redentor ingressos","Carnaval Rio 2026","passeio Pão de Açúcar","Réveillon Copacabana 2026","praias de Ipanema e Leblon","passeio de escuna Búzios","Rio de Janeiro é seguro para turistas","melhores hotéis de luxo no Rio de Janeiro","lua de mel no Rio de Janeiro"],"hreflang":["en","pt-BR"],"attribution":{"author":{"type":"Organization","name":"TravelWell.World"},"publisher":{"type":"Organization","name":"TravelWell.World LLC"},"reviewed_by":{"type":"Organization","name":"TravelWell.World"},"digital_source_type":"CompositeWithTrainedAlgorithmicMediaD