mary","tropical":"evidenced"},"commission_lane":["DMC","affiliate"],"commission_embedded":false,"commission_basis":"lane"},{"name":"Punta Gorda — Garífuna culture (UNESCO)","tier":"essential","source":"https://roatantourbase.com/excursion-guides/our-favorite-things-to-do-and-see-in-coxen-hole","hook":"Roatán''s oldest settlement; UNESCO-recognized Garífuna heritage, with the April 12 anniversary celebration","si":"expedition","blurb":"Roatán''s oldest settlement; UNESCO-recognized Garífuna heritage, with the April 12 anniversary celebration","commission":"cultural excursion via DMC (affiliate)","wells":["activities"],"wells_basis":"full pass 2026-10-05, additive — text","si_all":["expedition"],"shelf_fit":{"diveglobal":"destination","expedition":"primary","tropical":"destination"},"commission_lane":["DMC","affiliate"],"commission_embedded":false,"commission_basis":"2026-10-05: Fora removed - excluded by David 2026-09-05; the remaining route kept","commission_was":"cultural excursion via DMC (Fora/affiliate)"},{"name":"West Bay Beach","source":"https://www.royalcaribbean.com/inspire/what-is-roatan-known-for","hook":"Roatán''s iconic white-sand shoreline; warm shallows, reef snorkeling straight off the sand","si":"tropical","blurb":"Roatán''s iconic white-sand shoreline; warm shallows, reef snorkeling straight off the sand","commission":"anchors West Bay resort/villa stays (MoR villa)","tier_absent_reason":"not-sold","wells":["activities"],"wells_basis":"derived from name/blurb/hook","si_all":["diveglobal","tropical"],"shelf_fit":{"diveglobal":"evidenced","expedition":"destination","tropical":"primary"},"commission_lane":["hotel"],"commission_embedded":false,"commission_basis":"2026-10-05: Fora removed - excluded by David 2026-09-05; the remaining route kept","si_raw":"Tropical/Beaches","si_map_basis":"normalised from free text ''Tropical/Beaches'' by gen_normalise_jewel_si","commission_was":"anchors West Bay resort/villa stays (Fora / MoR villa)"}],"faq":[{"q":"What''s the real risk to plan for?","a":"The load-bearing risk is mainland crime, and the plan is to stay in-zone. Fly direct into RTB, keep the trip airport → island, and never route overland through the gang zones.","source":"https://www.gov.uk/foreign-travel-advice/honduras","si_tag":"safety"},{"q":"Is diving Roatán''s walls dangerous — and can I fly out afterward?","a":"Wall diving rewards depth discipline and respect for the no-fly window, and Roatán has an unusual first-response advantage. Recreational divers work the crest and upper wall (≤60–100 ft); wreck and deep-wall profiles trend technical and are certification-gated. Allow no-fly-after-diving of 18–24 hours before your RTB flight, and note the on-island Cornerstone Hyperbaric Chamber (adjacent to Anthony''s Key Resort, a DAN partner) — a genuine safety edge for a wall-diving island. **What makes Roatán''s diving special? ** *(Dive Liveaboards / Diving)* Roatán delivers a serious wall reef within minutes of the dock plus a rare repeat-rate track record. Within a 10-minute boat ride off West Bay/West End you reach ~30 named dive sites, from a 15-ft sandy playground with feeding eagle rays to 100-ft+ wall drop-offs, wrecks, and canyon swim-throughs; CoCo View Resort claims the highest repeat rate of any dive resort worldwide (1,600+ guests five times over).","source":"anthonyskey.com, 2026-07-07","si_tag":"safety","accessed":"2026-07-07"},{"q":"How much is the Roatán reef fee, and is it required?","a":"Yes, it is mandatory and it is small. The Roatán Marine Park conservation fee is $10/year or $5/day, and it funds the very reef you came to dive and snorkel.","source":"roatan.online, 2026-07-07","si_tag":"tropical","accessed":"2026-07-07"},{"q":"Is Roatán good for a honeymoon?","a":"Yes — Roatán runs a genuine adults-only luxury lane on top of the diving. Ibagari Boutique Hotel is adults-only (12+), holds a Michelin Key 2025, and sits between West Bay and West End; private West Bay villas and sunset-cocktail liveaboard finales round out the romance product.","source":"guide.michelin.com, 2026-07-07","si_tag":"romance","accessed":"2026-07-07"},{"q":"Can I snorkel with whale sharks from Roatán?","a":"Yes, via a day-trip to neighboring Utila, and only by snorkel. Utila is one of the few places on earth with year-round whale-shark potential, peaking late March–April; the animals are protected, so it is surface snorkeling only — no diving with them and no touching.","source":"thisisutila.com, 2026-07-07","si_tag":"adventure","accessed":"2026-07-07"}],"seo":{"meta_title":"Roatán, Honduras (Bay Islands) — Diving, Liveaboards & West Bay Beach | TravelWell.World","search_language":"es-HN","local_keywords":["buceo Roatán","West Bay Roatán","Islas de la Bahía","tiburón ballena Utila","arrecife mesoamericano buceo","hoteles de buceo Roatán","cámara hiperbárica Roatán"],"hreflang":["en","es-HN"],"jsonld_type":"TouristDestination","primary_keyword":"Roatán","attribution":{"author":{"type":"Organization","name":"TravelWell.World"},"publisher":{"type":"Organization","name":"TravelWell.World LLC"},"reviewed_by":{"type":"Organization","name":"TravelWell.World"},"digital_source_type":"CompositeWithTrainedAlgorithmicMediaDigitalSource","digital_source_vocab":"https://schema.org/IPTCDigitalSourceEnumeration","last_verified":"2026-08-20","last_verified_basis":"safety.fcdo.read","verified_against":[{"name":"UK Foreign, Commonwealth & Development Office","url":"https://www.gov.uk/foreign-travel-advice/honduras","read":"2026-08-20T14:48:43Z","source_updated":"2026-07-29T16:40:19+01:00"}]},"content_freshness":"2026-07-07","long_tail":["Roatán diving guide","Roatán liveaboard Aggressor","West Bay Beach Roatán","whale shark snorkel Utila from Roatán","is Roatán safe to visit 2026","Roatán hyperbaric chamber"]},"booking":{"advisory_authority":"FCDO"},"si_checklist_25":null,"sis_present":[{"si":"diveglobal","status":"live"},{"si":"tropical","status":"live"}],"ultra":[{"name":"Ibagari Boutique Hotel","