uayúa)","tier":"essential","source":"https://www.visitelsalvador.ai/blog/ruta-de-las-flores-guide-complet-villages | Accessed 2026-07-07","timing":"Dry season Nov–Apr","when_source":"derived from destination timing","timing_type":"SEASONAL-WINDOW","hook":"Terraced falls with cliff jumps and rappels. The 7 Waterfalls hike requires a mandatory guide — flash-flood, slick-rock, and cliff-jump hazards make guided mandatory","si":"expedition","blurb":"Terraced falls with cliff jumps and rappels. The 7 Waterfalls hike requires a mandatory guide — flash-flood, slick-rock, and cliff-jump hazards make guided mandatory","when":"Dry season Nov–Apr","commission":"Local guide via DMC; commissionable through operator (guided-only)","accessed":"2026-07-07","wells":["activities"],"wells_basis":"derived from name/blurb/hook","si_all":["expedition"],"shelf_fit":{"culinary":"destination","culture":"destination","expedition":"primary"},"commission_lane":["operator","DMC","guide"],"commission_embedded":false,"commission_basis":"lane"},{"name":"Concepción de Ataco street art + coffee","tier":"essential","source":"https://www.visitelsalvador.ai/blog/ruta-de-las-flores-guide-complet-villages | Accessed 2026-07-07","timing":"Dry season Nov–Apr","when_source":"derived from destination timing","timing_type":"SEASONAL-WINDOW","hook":"El Salvador''s most photogenic mural town — indigenous-history murals, Mirador de la Cruz, indigo-dye workshops, weekend street festival","si":"culture","blurb":"El Salvador''s most photogenic mural town — indigenous-history murals, Mirador de la Cruz, indigo-dye workshops, weekend street festival","when":"Dry season Nov–Apr","commission":"Mural-walk + coffee-finca combo via DMC; workshop fees via operator","accessed":"2026-07-07","wells":["activities"],"wells_basis":"derived from name/blurb/hook","si_all":["culture"],"shelf_fit":{"culinary":"destination","culture":"primary","expedition":"destination"},"commission_lane":["operator","DMC"],"commission_embedded":fals